    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "5 Kerry Lee is purpose built as student accommodation and is located at the top of Oakpark a short walk from the MTU North Campus. Accommodation briefly comprises of 4 x bedrooms and all are ensuite and also have built in storage and study desks. There is a large living and dining room, guest wc, lovely back garden and off street parking to the front of the home.\r\n\r\nDue to planning restrictions set by Kerry County Council this home is to be let to \r\n\r\nFor further information on LEASE OPTIONS, details on summer lets etc simply reply to this advert.\r\n\r\nWhilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intending purchasers / lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of information given."
      },
